  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans WLC/001, WLC/002 and Design and Access Statement submitted 12 April 2011, 288 - 290 Worton Road Broucher and Supporting statement submitted 02 June 2011 and email Correspondence submitted 06 June 2011 therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The premises shall be used for Non residential training college and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in Class D1 of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification).",
    "Condition : 4 - No fans, louvres, ducts or other external plant shall be installed without the prior approval of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times 8am and 11pm."
